    "media:imagetext": "PAN AMERICAN AIRWAYS, INC.\nGENERAL OFFICES - CHRYSLER BUILDING\nNEW YORK CITY\nDecember\n4\n1 9\n3 3\nMrs. H. M. Bixby,\nBolton Landing,\nNew York.\nMy dear Mrs. Bixby:\nI am sorry to have to tell you that your\nhusband informs us in a cable this morning that due to\nrecent developments in connection with our business in China,\nhe has had to put off his return home.\nI know you will\nbe deeply disappointed not to have him with you in time for\nChristmas, but I hope\nthat this will be merely a brief\npostponement and that he will be able to return before long.\nWith kindest regards.\nSincerely yours,\nSimogan\nS. W. Morgan\nSWW: FP\ncc: Mr. Bixby\nYAUDARAS\nCONTRACTORS 10 THE UNTTED STATES AND FORETON GOVEKNMENTS FOR AIK MAIL SERVICE BETWEEN THE UNITED STATES AND THE WEST INDIES, MEXICO, CONTRAL AND SOUTH AMCRIC\nRATES AND SCHEDULES OBTAINABLE AT ANY U.S. OR FOREIGN POST OFFICE, OR AT ANY OFFICE OF THE PAN AMERICAN AIRWAYS SYSTEM",
